<span id="Sx3.T1.1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx3.T1.1.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline ltx_font_italic">Centralised</span>, state-level participation, consensus seeking among political parties and citizen representatives</span>
</span></td>
<td id="Sx3.T1.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
